	(text "CC1101 FUNCTIONAL PLACEHOLDER\n\nMODULE / BARE-IC IMPLEMENTATION PENDING\nRF MATCHING / FILTERING / ANTENNA INTERFACE PENDING\nGDO2 INTENTIONALLY OMITTED\n\nCS HAS 10k HARDWARE PULL-UP TO +3V3\n\nNO FOOTPRINT\nDO NOT ROUTE"
